<h2>About</h2>

<section class="form-section">
    <h3>About This App</h3>
    <p>A lab seat reservation system for DLSU students and technicians to manage laboratory bookings.</p>
</section>

<section class="form-section">
    <h3>NPM Packages</h3>
    <div class="reservations-list">
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>Express</h4><span class="status-badge active">v5.2.1</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>Web framework for Node.js used to handle routing and HTTP requests.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>Mongoose</h4><span class="status-badge active">v9.2.4</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>MongoDB object modeling tool used to define schemas and interact with the database.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>Express Handlebars</h4><span class="status-badge active">v8.0.6</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>Templating engine used to render dynamic HTML views on the server side.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>Express Session</h4><span class="status-badge active">v1.19.0</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>Middleware for managing user sessions, used to keep users logged in across requests.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>Bcrypt</h4><span class="status-badge active">v6.0.0</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>Library for hashing and comparing passwords securely before storing in the database.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>@Handlebars/Allow-Prototype-Access</h4><span class="status-badge active">v1.0.5</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>Allows Handlebars to access Mongoose document prototypes when rendering templates.</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="form-section">
    <h3>Frontend Libraries</h3>
    <div class="reservations-list">
        <div class="reservation-card">
            <div class="card-header"><h4>Bootstrap</h4><span class="status-badge success">v5.3.3</span></div>
            <div class="card-body"><p>CSS framework used in the profile page for modals, tabs, and responsive layout components.</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>